# The build context is an ALLOWLIST: ignore everything, then allow back only
# what web.Dockerfile COPYs. Without this the whole checkout went to the
# builder, including data/ (the family's database and tokens), .env and the
# real config.json. tests/test_build_files.py keeps this list in step with
# the Dockerfile's COPY lines.
*
!requirements.txt
!requirements.lock
!src
!VERSION
!config.example.json
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
